CVE-2026-42306 exp:2026-09-12

# CVE-2026-27145: Go stdlib crypto/x509 certificate parsing DoS.
# Carriers (generated 2026-08-19):
#   gcr.io/cadvisor/cadvisor:v0.52.1, grafana/grafana:13.0.6-ubuntu
# Each is a pinned third-party image we cannot rebuild, so the fix
# only reaches us when the publisher ships a new tag.
# Why not exploitable: These only process certificates from our own PKI (not
# untrusted external sources), so maliciously crafted certificates cannot
# reach the vulnerable parsing code.
CVE-2026-27145 exp:2026-09-12


